  titulo: "SGT — Queue Management"
  resumen: "Queue management system for Cooperativa JEP branches with an offline local node and sync with headquarters."
  contenido: |
    ## Problem

    Branches needed to keep managing service queues even when the connection to headquarters went down.

    ## Solution

    Six-application architecture: central server, a local node per branch with two-way sync, kiosk, operator console, and TV display.

    ## Features

    - Kiosk that issues tickets with QR codes
    - Operator console and call display
    - Offline operation with two-way sync
    - Consolidated CSV reports and Active Directory authentication
